{"id":"porque_","lemma":"porqué","pos":"noun","rank":737,"glosses":["a reason (e.g. the reason why something happens)"],"ipa":"/poɾˈke/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"porqués"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c6/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-porqu%C3%A9.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Tom sabe el porqué?","en":"Does Tom know why?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799410"},{"text":"Déjame explicar el porqué.","en":"Let me explain why.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448486"},{"text":"¿Alguna vez te preguntaste el porqué?","en":"Don't you ever wonder why?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/581693"},{"text":"Me gustaría saber porqué.","en":"I'd like to know why."},{"text":"Es fácil comprender el porqué.","en":"It's easy to understand why."}]}